      story: Thomas Spiritkeeper was born around a spoils camp, where paid violence,
        marching boots, and camp discipline surrounded the cradle. As a child, Thomas
        Spiritkeeper lived through a market thief circle, learning shortcuts, loyalty,
        dirty angles, and the price of fear. As a young adult, Thomas Spiritkeeper
        worked through a toll bridge gang, learning ambushes, bad roads, guilt, and
        the cost of trusting desperate people. They enter the dojo to buy distance
        from old crimes.
